[I] Libraries implementing some freedesktop.org specifications

[T] libsfdo is a collection of small C libraries implementing some of the
[T] freedesktop.org specifications, such as base directories, desktop
[T] entries and icon theme lookup. It is used by the labwc Wayland
[T] compositor and related projects.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/vyivel/libsfdo

